What it does:

This is just a little program that lets the user guess a number between 1
and ?? (I have it set for 44) when they logon.  the wheel spins and the
number comes up.  If they guessed the correct number, they Win the Bonus
Time (Defaulted at 30 minutes)   It's not as easy as it sounds.
If they lose, NOTHING.  There is no penalty.

INSTALLATION:

Put the LotteryWheel.arexx Pfile someplace that you want to run it from.

What I do is put it in my Sys.welcome sequence as such

{#0pfiles:lotterywheel.arexx}
^
|
--- be sure to do your Ctrl-Q.  

That's it. Nice and Simple.  It doesn't make any new files, or keep
track of anything, so it doesn't make any mess on your system.



I hope you enjoy this.  and Watch for Other Games and Utilities from
